---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
---
<Layout lang="en" title="Privacy Policy - Crepuscular's Villa" alternates={[{ lang: 'zh-CN', url: 'https://crepus.asia/privacy/zh' }]}>
    <Header />
    <main class="main-content">
        <section class="content-section safe-zone">
            <div class="container">
                <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
                <p><strong>First Updated: February 26, 2026</strong></p>
                <p><strong>Last Updated: May 19, 2026</strong></p>
                <p>Welcome to my personal website. Your privacy is important to me. This policy explains how I handle data when you visit this site.</p>
                
                <h2>1. Information I Collect</h2>
                <p>To provide a better browsing experience or service, I collect the following information:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Information You Provide:</strong> When you fill out a contact form or leave a comment on this site, you may provide your name, email address, and any other details you enter.</li>
                    <li><strong>Information Collected Automatically:</strong> When you visit this site, server logs or third-party services automatically record basic traffic data such as your IP address, browser type, operating system, referring pages, and access times.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>2. Use of Third-Party Services</h2>
                <p>This site uses the following third-party services, which may collect your information via cookies or other technologies (governed by their respective privacy policies):</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Analytics and Hosting Tools:</strong> This site uses Cloudflare to monitor traffic, optimize site performance, and provide basic hosting services.</li>
                    <li><strong>Donation Features:</strong> This site includes donation links or QR codes for WeChat Pay and Alipay+. Donation transactions are processed entirely by these third-party platforms. This site <strong>does not</strong> collect or store any of your payment accounts, bank card numbers, or financial information.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>3. Form Data Processing and Storage</h2>
                <p>If you submit a form on this website:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> The data is used solely to respond to your inquiries or provide requested services.</li>
                    <li><strong>Storage:</strong> The form data you submit is securely stored in the D1 database provided by Cloudflare. Data will not be kept indefinitely unless you request its deletion or it is required by law.</li>
                    <li><strong>Sharing:</strong> I promise never to sell, rent, or abuse your personal contact information to any third party.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>4. Use of Cookies</h2>
                <p>This site and the aforementioned third-party services (such as Cloudflare) may place necessary cookies on your browser to maintain the site's basic functionality and security. You can clear or reject cookies at any time through your browser settings, but this may cause some features of this site to not function properly.</p>

                <h2>5. Your Rights (GDPR & PIPL)</h2>
                <p>Depending on your location, you have certain rights regarding your data (e.g., China's PIPL, EU's GDPR):</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Right to Access:</strong> You can ask what data I hold about you.</li>
                    <li><strong>Right to Rectify & Erasure:</strong> If information is incorrect, or if you wish for me to delete your form submission records, please inform me via the contact method below.</li>
                    <li><strong>Withdraw Consent:</strong> You can withdraw your consent to automatic data collection at any time by clearing your browser cookies or ceasing to use this site.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>6. Data Security</h2>
                <p>As a personal site, I use standard encryption technologies (such as HTTPS/SSL) provided by Cloudflare to protect data in transit. However, please note that no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.</p>

                <h2>7. Policy Updates</h2>
                <p>I may update this policy from time to time. You are advised to review this page periodically.</p>

                <h2>8. Contact Me</h2>
                <p>If you have any questions about this privacy policy or wish to exercise your data rights, please contact me at:</p>
                <p>Email: E-Crepuscular@outlook.com</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</Layout>
